{
  "name": "h_chain_compare",
  "description": "Head-to-head on the SAME molecules as h_chain_gqe.json (linear H10/H14, STO-3G, R = 1.0/1.5/2.0 A; whole-molecule FCI in every row): the prior-work routes next to DMET+GQE+QSCI. (1) DMET+SQD = same embedding as the GQE runs (AVAS on the central atoms, same system_id as h_chain_gqe), optimised LUCJ all pairs 2 reps, 10k shots, product and list subspace, seeds 1-3: GQE vs SQD at fixed embedding. (2) LASSCF/LASSQD with AVAS on all H 1s and two fragmentations: H2 units (4 qubits/fragment) and two halves (10 / 14 qubits/fragment; opposite-M_S doublets): DMET vs LAS at fixed sampler family. Compare err_vs_fci_kcal (total error), n_qubits, t_step3_s. Order: H10 LAS, H10 DMET+SQD, H14 LAS, H14 DMET+SQD (the H14 LUCJ optimisation on <=12 orbitals is the expensive part; check the first one). 84 runs. --out $B/h_chain_cmp.",
